@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine

[*] --> OffState : Start

state "Off" as OffState
state "Alarm Activated" as AlarmActivated
state "Ringing" as Ringing

OffState : entry/Initialize system
OffState : do/Wait for alarm setting or shutdown

AlarmActivated : entry/Set alarm time
AlarmActivated : do/Check if current time matches set time
AlarmActivated --> Ringing : [current time == alarm time]
AlarmActivated --> OffState : [user turns off alarm]

Ringing : entry/Ring the alarm
Ringing : do/Ringing continues until stopped
Ringing --> OffState : [user stops ringing]

OffState --> AlarmActivated : [alarm set or shutdown initiated]
Ringing --> OffState : [alarm stopped]

@enduml
